{"title":"The Birds of Palestine","link":"https://kottke.org/26/06/the-birds-of-palestine","date":1780412760000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1780331669-8292944c.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1780331669-8292944c.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1780331669-8292944c.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>Illustrator <a href=\"https://johnrooneyillustration.com\">John Rooney</a> has teamed up with the <a href=\"https://mecaforpeace.org\">Middle East Children’s Alliance</a> to produce and sell <a href=\"https://shoppalestine.org/products/birds-of-palestine\">this Birds of Palestine print</a>. Rooney <a href=\"https://instagram.com/p/DYzGBMmDElA\">on Instagram</a>: “All profits will be going towards providing emergency assistance to children and families in what is still a dire situation in Palestine.”\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/birds\">birds</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/John%20Rooney\">John Rooney</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/palestine\">palestine</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"f3daf6113ac70b38848e833575bd809fea4a8d2cbd8a8bbccaa75a96f384282c","category":"Sites"}